		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Vat-crafted by long-dead wizards as sanctum guards. Duergar, derro, and other dark-dwellers train them.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 13, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +3 (1d8 + poison) or 1 web +3, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fears Fire</strong>. Immediately roll morale with DISADV if exposed to fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d6 STR damage. Paralyzed at 0 STR.</p><p></p><p><strong>Slow Web</strong>. One target stuck in place. DEX 15+ on turn to escape, can only take action or move on turn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
